{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日，葉蒨文（Sophie）與男友曾展望（GM）遠赴青海崑崙山的聖地「西王母瑤池」。此行不僅是為了拜會西王母娘娘，Sophie 更在當地順道進行了莊嚴的拜師儀式，並分享了向師傅下跪敬茶的獨家相片。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">Sophie 接受獨家訪問時透露，原本行程只打算拜會西王母娘娘，但在討論行程期間，男友 GM 突然提議：「你不是打算拜師嗎？不如就在崑崙山拜師？」能在海拔 4300 米的聖地拜師意義非凡，但 Sophie 坦言起初十分擔心自己會出現高山症，不知身體狀況能否應付。幸好最終她只在乘坐旅遊巴時感到輕微暈眩，下車後很快便適應過來，令整個過程非常順利。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e28cdd24-4b1e-4f0a-832a-e4cd05ea6db4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20265bIoXi86Lb1783999538.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e28cdd24-4b1e-4f0a-832a-e4cd05ea6db4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">拜師當日更發生了一段奇妙的插曲。Sophie 憶述，當日請神後原本狂風大雨，環境相當惡劣，她的頭髮也被吹得凌亂濕透。然而神奇的是，到了正式拜師那一刻，風雨竟然奇蹟般減弱，天空也變得沒有那麼陰沉，讓儀式得以圓滿完成。連師傅也感嘆，從未試過在如此惡劣的環境下收徒弟，相信這次經歷對所有人來說都非常難忘。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">談及拜師的原因，Sophie 表示自己了解該宗教已超過一年，並與師傅及師兄弟接觸了一段時間。她強調：「對我來說，拜師絕不是兒戲，而是一份承諾。我希望自己已經準備好付出，願意透過這件事去幫助更多的人，才會去落實這份承諾。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b84784aa-0d6b-43bc-a870-78b3e51a146a.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QB4IXpTuFR1783999543.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b84784aa-0d6b-43bc-a870-78b3e51a146a.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">她透露，上個月親眼目睹師傅幫助別人的過程，令她感受甚深，從而下定決心拜師。隨後她進行「擲筊」請示，結果一來便擲出「三聖」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T02:22:38.550471+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":594,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}